From 8c5899084ad297c0d32bcbade9cc1fa26e7612a4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 11:48:51 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Cheats lists in alphabetical order

The Digimon and map lists of the Cheats menu are sorted by the name shown, letters compared as capitals. Each row's
key is taken once as it is added (a name can be in a DIGI.DAT record read from the disc) and kept in the save
extension area, which no card operation uses while the menu is open. The techniques list keeps the id order.

The MENU overlay pays for it with smaller code elsewhere in the menu (row heights and view titles as tables, one
release-wait helper, merged confirm cases): MENU is 32 bytes smaller (0xd7d0) and the resident exe 32 bytes smaller.
